> r(c: u32 in 0..65535) = (c * 255 + 32895) >> 16
> range r
range of r -> u32:
  0..255
  fits in u8
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> avg(x: u32, y: u32) = (x & y) + ((x xor y) >> 1)
> avg2(x: u32, y: u32) = u32((u64(x) + u64(y)) >> 1)
> equiv avg avg2
avg and avg2 are equal on the domain of avg (proved by SAT: 745 AIG nodes, 833 conflicts)
